    {
      "id": "claim_4005ba7861054a4cb87e76df2258cc97",
      "statement": "base92ToUint8Array rejects any character not present in the 92-character ALPHABET (carry === undefined || carry === INVALID) by throwing 'Invalid base92 character'; this guards against out-of-bounds charCodes reading as undefined and unmapped chars otherwise flowing through the decode arithmetic as digit 255 and corrupting the output.",
